const getVideoEmbed=url=>{try{const parsed=new URL(url);if(!['http:','https:'].includes(parsed.protocol))return null;const host=parsed.hostname.replace(/^www\./,'');if(host==='youtu.be')return `https://www.youtube.com/embed/${parsed.pathname.split('/').filter(Boolean)[0]||''}`;if(host.endsWith('youtube.com')){const id=parsed.searchParams.get('v')||parsed.pathname.split('/').filter(Boolean).pop();return id?`https://www.youtube.com/embed/${id}`:null}if(host.endsWith('vimeo.com')){const id=parsed.pathname.split('/').filter(Boolean).pop();return id?`https://player.vimeo.com/video/${id}`:null}return null}catch{return null}};

